15
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
If you don't mind, tell us a bit more about yourself and what you're up to these days.

16
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Well, first and foremost, I'm an avid fan and listener of On the Brink and very excited to be with you today.

17
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Thank you.

18
